Package: cogcor
Title: Cognitive Correlates Cluster Analysis Toolkit
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Your Name", email = "your.email@institution.nl", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for clustering and visualising cognitive domain profiles,
    developed for the COGCO-R study. Supports UMAP-based and hierarchical
    k-means clustering, group-wise comparison plots, individual-level
    heterogeneity visualisation, and internal cluster validity and bootstrap
    stability evaluation.
